### Linked List Q&A

**Q: Remove all elements with given value**
```python
def removeElements(head, val):
    dummy = ListNode(0)
    dummy.next = head
    curr = dummy
    while curr.next:
        if curr.next.val == val:
            curr.next = curr.next.next
