   Approach: Two pointers
   Time: O(n)  Space: O(1)

4. Given a linked list, reverse it
   Approach: Three pointers (prev, current, next)
   Time: O(n)  Space: O(1)

5. Implement a binary search on sorted array
   Approach: Binary search
   Time: O(log n)  Space: O(1)
```

### Round 2: Medium-Level Questions
```
6. Given an array of intervals, merge overlapping ones
   Approach: Sort and merge
   Time: O(n log n)  Space: O(1)

7. Find longest substring without repeating characters
   Approach: Sliding window with hash map
   Time: O(n)  Space: O(min(m,n))

8. Number of islands in a grid
   Approach: DFS/BFS
   Time: O(m*n)  Space: O(m*n)

9. Merge two sorted linked lists
   Approach: Merge two pointers
   Time: O(n+m)  Space: O(1)

10. Find lowest common ancestor in binary tree
    Approach: Recursive DFS
    Time: O(n)  Space: O(h)
```

### Round 3: Hard Questions
```
