    Approach: BFS
    Time: O(n * L²)  Space: O(n)

18. Edit distance (Levenshtein)
    Approach: 2D DP
    Time: O(m*n)  Space: O(m*n)

19. Maximum rectangle in histogram
    Approach: Monotonic stack
    Time: O(n)  Space: O(n)

